sonalized boxes with his distinctive band. تقييم Cigar Aficionado 93.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Exhibición No.4\", \"color\": \"#B22222\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1875, Petit Corona format (42 x 127mm). The perfect introduction to the Romeo y Julieta universe — sweet, floral, slightly creamy. Experts recommend starting here before venturing toward the Churchill.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exhibición No.4\", \"Exhibición No.3\"]}, {\"name\": \"Wide Churchill\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Thick format (55 x 178mm), same length as the Churchill but ring gauge 55 — one of the widest ever produced in Cuba. The increased wrapper surface intensifies the creamy and فانيليا notes. Smoked in 60 دقيقة. Reserved for المتحمسون who do not compromise on ring gauge.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Wide Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Regional Editions\", \"color\": \"#9B2335\", \"story\": \"Romeo y Julieta produces annual regional editions exclusively for different markets — Germany, Spain, UK, Benelux. The Cazadores EL (2018, Germany) and Short Churchills EL are particularly sought after. Some الجامعون travel across Europe solely to acquire local regional editions.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"Cazadores\", \"Short Churchill\", \"Coloniales\"]}]', '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill smoked his first Romeo y Julieta at 21 in Cuba and never stopped. He smoked 8 to 10 cigars per day. His doctor warned him — Churchill replied: \'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' He died at 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he reportedly smoked over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill fumaba his first Romeo y Julieta at 21 in Cuba and never stopped. He fumaba 8 to 10 cigars per day. His doctor warned him — Churchill replied: \'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' Murió a los 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he supuestamente fumaba over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill rauchte his first Romeo y Julieta at 21 in Cuba and never stopped. He rauchte 8 to 10 cigars per day. His doctor warned him — Churchill replied: \'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' Er starb im Alter von 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he angeblich rauchte over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill smoked his first Romeo y Julieta at 21 in Cuba and never stopped. He smoked 8 to 10 cigars per day. His doctor warned him — Churchill replied: \'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' 他以 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he 据报道 smoked over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill smoked his first Romeo y Julieta at 21 in Cuba and never stopped. He smoked 8 to 10 cigars per day. His doctor warned him — Churchill replied: \'My doctor told me to stop having dinners. We parted ways.\' توفي عن عمر 90, cigar in hand.\"}, {\"name\": \"Clark Gable\", \"anecdote\": \"The Hollywood actor had his Romeo y Julieta delivered directly to MGM Studios. During the filming of Gone with the Wind, he يُقال إن smoked over 300 cigars.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Champagne\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral notes of the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"Tea\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Champán\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral notas de the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"Té\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"Champagner\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral Noten von the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"Tee\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"香槟\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral 风味： the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"茶\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]', '[{\"type\": \"الشامبانيا\", \"name\": \"Bollinger R.D. 2007\", \"notes\": \"The fine bubble and minerality of Bollinger sublimate the floral نكهات: the Churchill in an accord of absolute elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Springbank 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The slight peat and salt of Springbank perfectly counterbalance the creamy sweetness of a Romeo y Julieta.\"}, {\"type\": \"الشاي\", \"name\": \"Darjeeling First Flush\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s most floral tea meets Cuba\'s most floral cigar. A delicate pairing reserved for sunny afternoons.\"}]');
